This repository carries work under two licences, matching the projects the
pieces derive from.

kernel/
    GPL-2.0-only. Derived from the Linux ov02c10 driver.

libcamera/
    LGPL-2.1-or-later. Derived from libcamera.

Everything else (scripts, tuning tools, documentation)
    LGPL-2.1-or-later.

No vendor tuning data is included. tuning/extract-tuning.py reads a file that
is already on your machine, under whatever licence your camera driver carries.
